    "restype": "quick_app",
    "name": "KlikBand",
    "description": "Daily worship companion for Muslims: prayer times with countdown and alerts, guided dhikr and tasbih, Hijri calendar and Islamic holidays, fasting reminders, Qibla, Asmaul Husna, duas and an Umrah guide.\n\nAny place in the world can be sent with KlikBand's AstroBox plugin, using the Kemenag (Indonesia), Muslim World League, Umm al-Qura or ISNA method.\n\nOpen source, free, no account, fully offline. Available in Indonesian, English and Chinese.\n\nCommunity quick app, not an official Xiaomi product.",
